config WDT_MT8188
	bool "MediaTek MT8188 watchdog driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_MEDIATEK_MT8188_WDT_ENABLED
	select HAS_WDT_DISABLE_AT_BOOT
	select HAS_WDT_NO_CALLBACKS
	help
	  Enable the driver for the watchdog of the MediaTek MT8188 top reset
	  generation unit (TOPRGU).

	  It offers one timeout of 2 to 31 seconds, and an expiry resets the
	  SoC.  The unit raises no interrupt before the reset, so a timeout
	  cannot have a callback.
